### Weighings — CREATE into a lot (expects 201 Created; net = gross − tare is added to the lot stock)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@collectionId = 1
@materialId = 1
@materialLotId = 1

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/weighings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pesaje de cartón jornada centro",
  "collectionId": {{collectionId}},
  "materialId": {{materialId}},
  "materialLotId": {{materialLotId}},
  "grossWeightKg": 120.5,
  "tareWeightKg": 2.5,
  "description": "Pacas de cartón corrugado"
}

### Weighings — CREATE without lot (expects 201 Created; no stock change)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/weighings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pesaje sin lote",
  "collectionId": {{collectionId}},
  "materialId": {{materialId}},
  "grossWeightKg": 40
}

### Weighings — CREATE with tare >= gross (expects 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/weighings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tara inválida",
  "collectionId": {{collectionId}},
  "materialId": {{materialId}},
  "grossWeightKg": 10,
  "tareWeightKg": 10
}

### Weighings — CREATE sending netWeightKg (expects 400 Bad Request: the server computes it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/weighings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Neto enviado",
  "collectionId": {{collectionId}},
  "materialId": {{materialId}},
  "grossWeightKg": 50,
  "netWeightKg": 50
}
